[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_MAGIC]
Magic Enlightenment

[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_MAGIC__cost_factor]
Magic Enlightenment Policy Cost

[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_MAGIC_desc]


[en.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_1_GODS]
Too many Sorcerers!

[en.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_1_GODS_desc]
There’s nothing a fireball can’t solve. If there is, then use two fireballs.

[en.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_2_EXCEL]
Magic is Everywhere

[en.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_2_EXCEL_desc]
Nopony is above the law, unless it’s the law of physics, as we’ve broken them long ago.

[en.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_3_NORMAL]
Magic is Nature

[en.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_3_NORMAL_desc]
Just like fishes don’t realize they are in water, we don’t realize we have magic. Who would think about how to breathe?

[en.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_4_MUGGLE]
Muggle is Nature

[en.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_4_MUGGLE_desc]
One masters strength is a warrior, one masters knowledge is a scholar, one masters crafting is a craftsman.
One masters politics is a king, one masters fraud is a politician, one masters art is a fraud.
One masters magic is a witch that deserves to be burned at the stake.

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_MAGIC]
魔法启蒙度

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_MAGIC__cost_factor]
魔法启蒙度花费

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_MAGIC_desc]


[zh.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_1_GODS]
法师太多了！

[zh.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_1_GODS_desc]
没有什么是一发火球解决不了的问题，如果有，那就两发。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_2_EXCEL]
魔法无处不在

[zh.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_2_EXCEL_desc]
没有小马凌驾于法则之上，除非是物理法则，因为我们早就打破它们了。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_3_NORMAL]
魔法是自然

[zh.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_3_NORMAL_desc]
就像鱼不知道自己在水里一样，我们也不知道自己有魔法。谁会去思考如何呼吸呢？

[zh.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_4_MUGGLE]
麻瓜是自然

[zh.IDEA_ERA_MAGIC_4_MUGGLE_desc]
擅长力量的是战士，擅长知识的是学者，擅长制造的是工匠。
擅长政治的是国王，擅长欺诈的是政客，擅长艺术的是骗子。
擅长魔法的是女巫，该被绑在柱子上烧死。
